Hey. How was basketball?

30
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:49,650
It was fun. Right up until Chandler got a finger in the eye.

31
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:51,740
Oh, no. Who did that?

32
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,240
Chandler.

33
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,540
Yeah.

34
00:02:57,450 --> 00:02:58,660
- Rash?     - Yeah?

35
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:01,830
What's Huggsy doing in the crib with Emma?

36
