140
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,790
- Give it to me!     - You can't have it.

141
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,040
- Give it to me!     - No.

142
00:10:05,170 --> 00:10:07,130
- I'll go in there.     - Oh, yeah.

143
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:08,510
- Come here!     - No!

144
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:12,640
- Give it to me!     - You're crazy! God.

145
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:14,970
Aha!

146
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:17,480
Damn you, Monica Geller hyphen Bing!

147
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:26,110
Hey, look who's here. It's Joey. And he brought home a friend.

148
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,360
Joey, Emma's right here.

149
00:10:27,530 --> 00:10:30,450
